measured on 2026-08-21 with two passing controls, and `incant/frontier`'s eight
stations were built on it. Something between then and now changed which shape the
parser refuses, and NOTHING HERE IDENTIFIES WHAT. A trap that inverted is a trap
whose cause moved, and the cause has not been looked for.

